# A stage0 sample program (docs/refined-examples/stage0/samples). Run it with
# `refined run`, or compile it with stage0 and run what stage0 builds.

depth is project
depth purpose "Recurse past a stated maxRecursion, so the bound's trap can be compared; a stage0 sample both runs agree on"
depth target console
depth version "0.1.0"
depth language refined 1
depth standardLibrary 1
depth allows write console.stdout none
depth requires none
depth includesModule depth
depth entry depth.main
